secr 3.1.5 is now on CRAN <https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=secr>. You can now view parameter estimates for all levels of a factor covariate simply by setting all.levels = TRUE in predict(). A few bugs are fixed (including the one regarding binomial count data from 2017-12-08). Other changes <http://www.otago.ac.nz/density/secr%203.1.5%20NEWS.txt> mostly prepare secr  to play with a forthcoming package for open population models.

